872192,"text_excerpt":"This is a great place to listen to jazz. Awesome bartender Phillip makes a mean hurricane. Samantha Pearl is performing today. She sounds Great! I always stop in when I am in town. Drinks are reasobably priced and I didn't try the Green Fairy Room, but let me know if you do."},{"business_id":"NptSlw3aDVtu-qtXcti7aA","review_id":"j29mp4xRRdjBKwlEt_PfOw","date":"2018-11-15T17:43:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9219053983688354,"text_excerpt":"We visited Mahogany Jazz Hall on a Friday night and had an awesome time. It is an intimate venue with limited seating. They feature live jazz music on a stage next to the bar, and we enjoyed all the music we heard while we were there. There is no cover, but they have a requirement of one drink per person per set, which isn't really enforced due to the crowd (we actually had to flag down the bartender and wait to order another round). They have a good selection of alcohol, including a cocktail list with a strong Absinthe leaning. I don't like Absinthe, but it is a unique and interesting theme. They have plenty of non-Absinthe offerings if, like me, Absinthe isn't your thing. We opted to vi..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"NptSlw3aDVtu-qtXcti7aA","photo_id":"d84EFni-eXlUzq5TWU2Khw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/d84EFni-eXlUzq5TWU2Khw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9161348938941956},{"business_id":"NptSlw3aDVtu-qtXcti7aA","photo_id":"OH9nYOoYwz9Pp4l4WZFVmg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/OH9nYOoYwz9Pp4l4WZFVmg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9050619602203369},{"business_id":"NptSlw3aDVtu-qtXcti7aA","photo_id":"BZWwHulUKLs3Sxfl1TiPog","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/BZWwHulUKLs3Sxfl1TiPog.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8995440602302551},{"business_id":"NptSlw3aDVtu-qtXcti7aA","photo_id":"OYCevUXn6TosE9-y-UP7Vg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/OYCevUXn6TosE9-y-UP7Vg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8943750262260437},{"business_id":"NptSlw3aDVtu-qtXcti7aA","photo_i